aList\" data-content=\"defensive-abilities\">  <li>ink cloud</li>  </ul></li>       </ul>  </div><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 0 ft</li>  <li>Swim 60 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +4 (1d3+2), tentacles +2 (1d4+1 plus grab)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">   </ul>   </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 15</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 15</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 11</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 12</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 2</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+2</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +4 (+8 grapple)</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 16  </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Improved Initiative</li>  <li>Lightning Reflexes</li>  <li>Multiattack</li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Perception +7</li>  <li>Swim +10</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   any ocean <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or school (3-12)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Ink Cloud (Ex)</strong> A squid can emit a 5-foot-radius cloud of ink once per minute as a free action while underwater. This cloud provides total concealment. The ink persists for 1 minute.  </p>  <p><strong> Jet (Ex)</strong> A squid can jet in a straight line as a full-round action. It does not provoke attacks of opportunity while jetting.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nSquids are aggressive predators that fear little and are more than willing to attack prey larger than themselves. \nSquid Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +1 natural; Speed swim 60 ft., jet 240 ft.; Attack tentacles (1d4 plus grab), bite (1d3); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 15, Con 11, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 2; Special Qualities low-light vision, ink cloud. \n4th-Level Advancement: Ability Scores Str +2, Con +2.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Squid (CR 1)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 1 \nXP 400 \nN Medium animal (aquatic)\n\nInit +6; Senses low-light vision; Perception +7   \nDefense   \nAC 13, touch 12, flat-footed 11 (+2 Dex, +1 natural)\n\nhp 13 (3d8)\n\nFort +3, Ref +7, Will +2 \nDefensive Abilities ink cloud (5-ft. radius)\n\n\n\nOffense   \nSpd swim 60 ft., jet 240 ft. \nMelee bite +4 (1d3+2), tentacles +2 (1d4+1 plus grab)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 15, Dex 15, Con 11, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 2 \nBase Atk +2; CMB +4 (+8 grapple); CMD 16 \nFeats Improved Initiative, Lightning Reflexes, Multiattack \nSkills Perception +7, Swim +10   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  any ocean \nOrganization solitary, pair, or school (3-12)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nInk Cloud (Ex) A squid can emit a 5-foot-radius cloud of ink once per minute as a free action while underwater. This cloud provides total concealment. The ink persists for 1 minute. \n Jet (Ex) A squid can jet in a straight line as a full-round action. It does not provoke attacks of opportunity while jetting.   \nDescription\n\nSquids are aggressive predators that fear little and are more than willing to attack prey larger than themselves. \nSquid Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +1 natural; Speed swim 60 ft., jet 240 ft.; Attack tentacles (1d4 plus grab), bite (1d3); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 15, Con 11, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 2; Special Qualities low-light vision, ink cloud. \n4th-Level Advancement: Ability Scores Str +2, Con +2.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":1},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":3},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","r