gnment: Always neutral.</li>\n<li>Treasure: None.</li>\n<li>Proficient with its natural weapons only. A non-combative herbivore treats its natural weapons as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"supplements":[]},"armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"size":"med","speeds":{"land":null,"fly":null,"flyManeuverability":"","swim":null,"climb":null,"burrow":null},"creatureTypes":["animal"],"creatureSubtypes":["aquatic"],"sources":[]},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/blue_29.jpg","_id":"RllZ9QfBB8KYnuli","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124841714,"modifiedTime":1795124844888,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"ckaiONi0uRf55iyy","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124841770,"modifiedTime":1795124844888,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/blue_29.jpg","name":"Animal","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>An animal is a living, nonhuman creature, usually a vertebrate with no magical abilities and no innate capacity for language or culture. Animals usually have additional information on how they can serve as companions.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<p>An animal has the following features (unless otherwise noted).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>d8 Hit Die.</li>\n<li>Base attack bonus equal to 3/4 total Hit Dice (medium progression).</li>\n<li>Good <em>Fortitude</em> and <em>Reflex</em> saves.</li>\n<li>Skill points equal to 2 + <em>Int</em> modifier (minimum 1) per Hit Die. The following are class skills for animals: <em>Acrobatics</em>, <em>Climb</em>, <em>Fly</em>, <em>Perception</em>, <em>Stealth</em>, and <em>Swim</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Traits</h2>\n<p>An animal possesses the following traits (unless otherwise noted in a creature’s entry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Intelligence</em> score of 1 or 2 (no creature with an <em>Intelligence</em> score of 3 or higher can be an animal).</li>\n<li><em>Low-light vision</em>.</li>\n<li>Alignment: Always neutral.</li>\n<li>Treasure: None.</li>\n<li>Proficient with its natural weapons only. A non-combative herbivore treats its natural weapons as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"classAssociations":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"animal","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"racial","level":3,"hd":8,"hp":13,"bab":"med","skillsPerLevel":2,"savingThrows":{"fort":{"value":"high"},"ref":{"value":"high"},"will":{"value":"low"}},"fc":{"hp":{"value":0},"skill":{"value":0},"alt":{"value":0,"notes":""}},"wealth":"","alignme